        <briefdescription>
<para>One-time patch initialisation, applied once per field before the first <ref refid="classNeoN_1_1finiteVolume_1_1cellCentred_1_1VolumeBoundaryFactory_1a7447a0202cffe2b0ec1c0fdfc5494710" kindref="member">update()</ref>. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>For patch data that is fixed for the lifetime of the field (e.g. constant mixed-BC coefficients). The default is a no-op; BCs that have nothing constant to set leave it untouched and do all their work in <ref refid="classNeoN_1_1finiteVolume_1_1cellCentred_1_1VolumeBoundaryFactory_1a7447a0202cffe2b0ec1c0fdfc5494710" kindref="member">update()</ref>. </para>
